    "displayName": "PL_INGEST_ORACLE",
    "description": "Metadata-driven Source -> Landing copy for Oracle-type connections (via an on-premises Data Gateway). A native Lookup activity queries ingestion.vw_ActiveIngestTables directly (no notebook in the loop) for every active Table row behind an Oracle Connection, already resolved to its ready-to-run SourceQuery, then Copies each one straight into Landing."
